OL,3,GNEWSAWW2 'greatest raid' medals appeal
OL,4,Araises #30k
OL,5,
OL,6,FHistoric medals from one of the
OL,7,F"greatest raids of all time" when World
OL,8,FWar Two Allied troops carried out a
OL,9,Fraid on a Nazi Germany-controlled dock
OL,10,Fwill go on display after a #29,000
OL,11,Ffund-raising target was reached.
OL,13,FMore than 600 men set off from Falmouth
OL,14,Fin March 1942 and the raid succeeded at
OL,15,Fputting the dock at St Nazaire in
OL,16,FFrance out of action to stop vessels
OL,17,Fbased there impeding Atlantic convoys.
OL,19,FThe National Maritime Museum Cornwall
OL,20,Fhas raised more than #30,000 to display
OL,21,Fmedals awarded to Lt Cdr Stephen
OL,22,FBeattie.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
