OL,5,
OL,6,FMuseum volunteer Jonathan Griffin said
OL,7,Fthe money would be used for a secure
OL,8,Fdisplay case so the medal could go on
OL,9,Fdisplay in Falmouth, where preparations
OL,10,Ffor the raid took place.
